  m_text: Italian semi-automatic pistol, widely used by armies and law enforcement
    agencies of many countries. It is characterized by precision shooting, a high
    margin of safety and a large magazine for 15 rounds of 9mm Parabellum caliber.
    It is easy to handle, ensures confident destruction of targets at medium range.
    Becomes a reliable companion of survivors in the chaos of the new world.
